until the estimate is at or below this many tokens. Default 12000.","anyOf":[{"type":"integer","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991},{"type":"null"}]}},"required":["conversation"]},"execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"}},{"name":"get_annotated_transcript","description":"Get annotated transcripts from session-export JSON paths, <harness>:<id> references, or Mastra thread URLs. Harnesses: agentmux, grok, omp, pi, claude, codex, hermes, cursor, copilot. A Mastra thread is mastra:thread:<id> or a Studio URL (https://<host>/agents/<agentId>/threads/<threadId>). Annotation is deterministic: the same session always gets the same happened, cost, waste, and correction fields, with no model call. Already annotated exports pass through. Writes each session to ~/.local/share/capability-replicas/annotated/<conversation>.annotated.json (CAPABILITY_ANNOTATED_DIR overrides the directory) and returns the sessions. Call: { sources: [\"claude:<id>\"], format?: \"default\" | \"raw\" }. format only changes how much of an item's text is kept in happened; the item itself is never clipped. Unreadable sources fail rather than returning partial transcripts.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"sources":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"format":{"default":"default","type":"string","enum":["default","raw"]}},"required":["sources"]},"execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"}},{"name":"run_improve-pr","description":"Improve a pull request by running OCR, fixing issues, making CI green, and addressing comments. Call: { prUrl: \"https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>/pull/<n>\" }. One pass; ciStatus says whether CI ended green.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"prUrl":{"type":"string","format":"uri"}},"required":["prUrl"]},"execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"}},{"name":"run_learn-from-transcript","description":"Learn from one agent transcript: two forensics passes in one thread, the thread saved as JSONL, then the tickets to file. Input is either an annotated-export JSON path or a conversation id (<harness>:<id>, mastra:thread:<id>, or a Studio thread URL); an id is resolved through get-annotated-transcript's readers and annotated first. Pass 1 asks learn-from-transcript/analyze.yaml with {path} set to the annotated export's absolute path; pass 2 asks learn-from-transcript/synthesize.yaml as written, in the same thread. Every stored message of the thread is written, one JSON object per line, beside the annotated exports as <conversation>.learn-from-transcript.jsonl. Pass 3 asks learn-from-transcript/log-tickets.yaml in the same thread; the reply's fenced ticket array is the run's result: [{ atask_id, linear_link }, ...]. Call: { source: \"claude:<id>\" | \"/path/to/session-export.json\", format?: \"default\" | \"raw\" }.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"source":{"type":"string"},"format":{"default":"default","type":"string","enum":["default","raw"]}},"required":["source"]},"execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"}},{"name":"run_experiment-design-supplied","description":"Independently validate supplied snapshots and register version-pinned experiments","inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"design":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"origin":{"oneOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","const":"scenario"},"prompt":{"type":"string"},"reference":{"type":"string"}},"required":["kind","prompt","reference"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","const":"adversarial"},"prompt":{"type":"string"},"generator":{"type":"string"},"model":{"type":"string"}},"required":["kind","prompt","generator","model"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"variants":{"minItems":2,"maxItems":20,"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","propertie